{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15204460","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15204460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1520446001:0":{"text":"영체가 사라졌어요...","source_cn":"灵体已经消失了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4693A1618A6D35FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520446002:0":{"text":"완벽하지 않은 술식으로 만든 거니까.","source_cn":"毕竟只是一个不完整术式的产物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02424714E24138F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520446003:0":{"text":"괜찮아요... 이걸로 충분해요. 정말 고마워요!","source_cn":"没关系……已经足够了。魔法师大人，谢谢你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58FCE469C88B4BCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520446004:0":{"text":"전 역시 영지로 돌아가서 모두를 돌봐야 할 것 같아요.","source_cn":"我也已经想好了，我还是回营地，继续照顾大家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54E23D1EFAD92B11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520446005:0":{"text":"그리고 진실은... 계속 비밀로 해주셨으면 해요. 당분간은 다른 아이들에게 알리지 말아 주세요.","source_cn":"还有……关于真相……希望你们可以继续帮我一起保密，暂时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAA257A67A64EC8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520446006:0":{"text":"저희도 그렇게 하는 게 좋다고 생각해요. 그리고 방금 전에 저희끼리 상의를 해봤는데...","source_cn":"当然，我们也认为这样处理比较好。另外，我们刚刚商量了一下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20589D6370113B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:8:1520446007:0":{"text":"우리는 톨로에게 정화한 가시 메뚜기 고기를 식량으로 공급하겠다는 결정을 전했다...","source_cn":"将有关于净化针蝗肉，来为营地提供食物的决定告诉了托洛……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x151A7C9A7584AE89","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리는 톨로에게 정화한 가시 메뚜기 고기를 식량으로 공급하겠다는 결정을 전했다...","female":"우리는 톨로에게 정화한 가시 메뚜기 고기를 식량으로 공급하겠다는 결정을 전했다...","variant_male_record_index":"184742","variant_female_record_index":"184743","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520446008:0":{"text":"저, 정말요?!","source_cn":"真、真的吗……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E76E4859D59700E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520446009:0":{"text":"말도 안 되는 제안이라고 생각하지? 나도 그래. 역시...","source_cn":"是不是觉得这个提议漏洞百出？我也这么觉得，干脆——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDA22CB0F70F73E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520446010:1":{"text":"...아니요! 제발 도와주세요. 제발... 저희를 살려주세요! 이렇게 부탁할게요...","source_cn":"——不，不！请帮帮我们……救救大家吧！求求你们，求求你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1548CD2BDDE63C5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1520446011:0":{"text":"모르간, 애 놀리지 말아요. 톨로, 걱정 마세요. 저희가 힘이 닿는 한, 가시 메뚜기를 계속 정화해서 여러분이 살아갈 수 있도록 도울게요.","source_cn":"摩根，别吓唬小孩子。托洛，你放心，我们会帮助营地的。只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x073CF56A53DA4EFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1520446012:0":{"text":"흑흑... 정, 정말 고맙습니다...!","source_cn":"呜呜……谢、谢谢你们……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x823F07AB6217EECD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520446013:0":{"text":"어, 얼른 돌아가서 이 소식을 모두에게 알려야겠어요!","source_cn":"我——我得回去，把这个消息告诉大家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3D9F2B4016DD128","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:加拉":{"text":"갈라","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:摩根":{"text":"모르간","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:托洛":{"text":"톨로","source":"托洛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"초대 멀린","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":5}}